                <mxCell id="n87" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=24;shadow=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" value="Request and issue paths use parent muxes: head/linear addresses select u_parameters; QK selects u_cache;&#xa;head_math_issue / attention_math_issue select u_math.start and parent operand capture.&#xa;attention_div_start selects u_div.start and numerator/denominator. See port-map manifest and functional overview." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="135" width="1600" x="40" y="2212" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n88" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=24;shadow=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" value="Block Functions &amp; Interfaces&#xa;llm_soc: Host frontend and autonomous graph; parent muxes, operand caches, scaling, softmax/V pass,&#xa;vector writes and token selection.&#xa;  TOP&#xa;  Parameters: USE_QUARTUS_MEMORY=1, PERF_COUNTERS=0, ENABLE_DEBUG_INDEX=0, ATTN_DIV_LANES=4,&#xa;SIGMOID_LANES=4&#xa;Source: llm_soc.sv:3&#xa;&#xa;reset_release: Asynchronous reset assertion; internal release after two rising edges. clk/rst_n -&gt;&#xa;core_rst_n.&#xa;  TOP.u_reset&#xa;Source: reset_release.sv:3&#xa;&#xa;logic_mul: Combinational bit products and carry-save reduction; a/b -&gt; product. No runtime multiply&#xa;operator.&#xa;  TOP.u_scalar_lo&#xa;  Role: Low unsigned byte of scalar_b_q multiplied by signed scalar_a_q.&#xa;  Parameters: A_W=39, B_W=8, OUT_W=48, SIGNED_A=1, SIGNED_B=0&#xa;  TOP.u_scalar_mid&#xa;  Role: Middle unsigned byte of scalar_b_q multiplied by signed scalar_a_q.&#xa;  Parameters: A_W=39, B_W=8, OUT_W=48, SIGNED_A=1, SIGNED_B=0&#xa;  TOP.u_scalar_hi&#xa;  Role: High signed nine-bit part of scalar_b_q multiplied by signed scalar_a_q.&#xa;  Parameters: A_W=39, B_W=9, OUT_W=48, SIGNED_A=1, SIGNED_B=1&#xa;  TOP.u_exp_mul&#xa;  Role: Softmax endpoint delta times twelve-bit interpolation fraction.&#xa;  Parameters: A_W=25, B_W=12, OUT_W=37, SIGNED_A=0, SIGNED_B=0&#xa;  TOP.u_noise_mul&#xa;  Role: Signed Gumbel lookup value times unsigned temperature_q.&#xa;  Parameters: A_W=24, B_W=8, OUT_W=33, SIGNED_A=1, SIGNED_B=0&#xa;Source: logic_mul.sv:4&#xa;&#xa;llm_gumbel_sample: Combinational Gumbel table: index U8 -&gt; signed value S24.&#xa;  TOP.u_gumbel_lookup&#xa;  Role: Gumbel lookup indexed by random_q[31:24].&#xa;Source: llm_gumbel_lut.svh:4&#xa;&#xa;llm_exp_sample: Combinational exp table: index U9 -&gt; value U25; default zero outside the table.&#xa;  TOP.u_exp_hi&#xa;  Role: Exp lookup at the selected interval index.&#xa;  TOP.u_exp_lo&#xa;  Role: Exp lookup at the adjacent index plus one.&#xa;Source: llm_exp_lut.svh:4&#xa;&#xa;llm_parameter_ram: Eight 32-bit lanes; compute row read / valid, host lane read and post-commit write&#xa;acknowledgement.&#xa;  TOP.u_parameters&#xa;  Role: Parameter image: 24576 x 256 bits; host accesses 32-bit lanes, compute reads complete rows.&#xa;  Parameters: ADDR_W=15, DEPTH=24576, USE_QUARTUS_MEMORY=1&#xa;Source: llm_parameter_ram.sv:5&#xa;&#xa;llm_bank_ram: Thirty-two S24 banks; rd_en/rd_addr -&gt; rd_data/rd_valid; masked writes and wr_busy&#xa;drain.&#xa;  TOP.u_vectors&#xa;  Role: Intermediate vector workspace: 96 x 768 bits; v_address_q/v_data/v_valid and masked&#xa;write_vector_q.&#xa;  Parameters: LANES=32, WIDTH=24, ROWS=96, ADDR_W=7, USE_QUARTUS_MEMORY=1&#xa;  TOP.u_cache&#xa;  Role: Causal K/V storage: 4096 x 768 bits; attention or parent k_read_address, k_data/k_valid and&#xa;cache writes.&#xa;  Parameters: LANES=32, WIDTH=24, ROWS=4096, ADDR_W=12, USE_QUARTUS_MEMORY=1&#xa;Source: llm_bank_ram.sv:5&#xa;&#xa;llm_math: STREAMING=1, 32 S24xS32 lanes; accept E0, product_valid E3, sum_valid E8, legacy done E9.&#xa;  TOP.u_math&#xa;  Parameters: STREAMING=1&#xa;Source: llm_math.sv:5&#xa;&#xa;llm_head_engine: Four ordered int8 chunks per row; parameter requests and parent math issue;&#xa;sum_valid/sum -&gt; S39 accumulator/done.&#xa;  TOP.u_head_engine&#xa;Source: llm_head_engine.sv:3&#xa;&#xa;llm_attention_engine: Causal K reads and parent math issue; rounded/scaled QK scores, score array,&#xa;maximum and done.&#xa;  TOP.u_attention_engine&#xa;Source: llm_attention_engine.sv:4&#xa;&#xa;llm_linear_engine: Two-word parameter prefetch, ternary dot issue, S39 accumulation; start/ready,&#xa;done/fault and cancellation drain.&#xa;  TOP.u_linear_engine&#xa;Source: llm_linear_engine.sv:3&#xa;&#xa;isqrt_u64: 32-step unsigned floor square root: start/radicand -&gt; busy/done/root.&#xa;  TOP.u_root&#xa;  Role: Parent RMS coefficient square root from root_input_q; root_busy/root_done/root return to&#xa;operator control.&#xa;Source: isqrt_u64.sv:1&#xa;&#xa;llm_attention_normalize: Eight four-lane batches; lane zero shared at top, three private dividers;&#xa;RNE/sign/clamp -&gt; vector/done.&#xa;  TOP.u_attention_normalize&#xa;  Parameters: DIV_LANES=4, USE_SHARED=1&#xa;Source: llm_attention_normalize.sv:3&#xa;&#xa;div: Unsigned restoring shift/subtract divider: start/numerator/denominator -&gt;&#xa;busy/done/quotient/remainder.&#xa;  TOP.u_div&#xa;  Role: Shared U64/U32 divider: parent RMS reciprocal or attention-normalizer lane zero via&#xa;numerator/start mux.&#xa;  Parameters: NUM_W=64, DEN_W=32&#xa;Source: div.sv:3&#xa;&#xa;sigmoid: start/x_raw/frac_bits -&gt; y_raw/busy/done; one table lookup and registered interpolation.&#xa;  TOP.g_sigmoid[0:3].u_sig (4 instances; inclusive ranges)&#xa;Source: sigmoid.sv:2&#xa;&#xa;Configuration: USE_QUARTUS_MEMORY=1, ATTN_DIV_LANES=4, SIGMOID_LANES=4.&#xa;PERF_COUNTERS=0 and ENABLE_DEBUG_INDEX=0. Other configurations require a separate expansion.&#xa;USE_SHARED=1: normalizer lane zero is connected to top u_div; only lanes 1, 2, 3 are children.&#xa;Packages are source context, not instances. Generate scopes are annotations, not modules.&#xa;Alternate memory hierarchy: see rtl_hierarchy_portable.drawio. Quartus is a demonstration backend." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="3384" width="1700" x="30" y="2372" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
