                <mxCell id="n1283" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=24;shadow=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;" value="Block Functions &amp; Interfaces&#xa;quartus_word_ram: Replaceable Quartus memory leaf; common-clock 1R/1W, OLD_DATA, no storage reset.&#xa;  TOP.u_parameters.g_ram_lane[0:7].u_storage.g_ip_tiled.g_tile[0:23].u_storage (192 instances;&#xa;inclusive ranges)&#xa;  Parameters: WIDTH=32, ROWS=1024, ADDR_W=10&#xa;  TOP.u_vectors.g_bank[0:31].u_storage.g_ip.u_storage (32 instances; inclusive ranges)&#xa;  Parameters: WIDTH=24, ROWS=96, ADDR_W=7&#xa;  TOP.u_cache.g_bank[0:31].u_storage.g_ip.u_storage (32 instances; inclusive ranges)&#xa;  Parameters: WIDTH=24, ROWS=4096, ADDR_W=12&#xa;Source: quartus_word_ram.sv:5&#xa;&#xa;altsyncram: External Quartus library primitive, unavailable as repository RTL. q_b read and port-A&#xa;writes.&#xa;  TOP.u_parameters.g_ram_lane[0:7].u_storage.g_ip_tiled.g_tile[0:23].u_storage.u_memory (192&#xa;instances; inclusive ranges)&#xa;  Parameters: WIDTH=32, ROWS=1024, ADDR_W=10&#xa;  TOP.u_vectors.g_bank[0:31].u_storage.g_ip.u_storage.u_memory (32 instances; inclusive ranges)&#xa;  Parameters: WIDTH=24, ROWS=96, ADDR_W=7&#xa;  TOP.u_cache.g_bank[0:31].u_storage.g_ip.u_storage.u_memory (32 instances; inclusive ranges)&#xa;  Parameters: WIDTH=24, ROWS=4096, ADDR_W=12&#xa;Source: external Quartus library; not resolved in repository.&#xa;&#xa;Configuration: USE_QUARTUS_MEMORY=1, ATTN_DIV_LANES=4, SIGMOID_LANES=4.&#xa;PERF_COUNTERS=0 and ENABLE_DEBUG_INDEX=0. Other configurations require a separate expansion.&#xa;USE_SHARED=1: normalizer lane zero is connected to top u_div; only lanes 1, 2, 3 are children.&#xa;Packages are source context, not instances. Generate scopes are annotations, not modules.&#xa;Alternate memory hierarchy: see rtl_hierarchy_portable.drawio. Quartus is a demonstration backend." vertex="1">
